Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Send captioned photos separately instead of as an album

Pick several photos or videos in the attach sheet, open them in the
viewer and give two or more of them different captions, then send (the
sheet's send button or the viewer's): they go out as separate messages,
each with its own caption, exactly like "Send without grouping". Stock
sends an album, and an album with 2+ captions shows none of them.

Everything else stays an album as before: no caption or one caption
(the attach bar's text field counts as one, on the first item), the
same caption on every item ("caption for all media" mode), send as
file (document albums show every caption), paid media, and editing.

One decision point in ChatActivity, before prepareSendingMedia, covers
both send buttons. Stored as CustomSettings key "autoUngroupCaptioned",
default on; no settings UI yet.
---
 .../telegram/messenger/CustomSettings.java    | 35 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../java/org/telegram/ui/ChatActivity.java    |  6 ++--
 2 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/CustomSettings.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/CustomSettings.java
index 4301002d..76f61e45 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/CustomSettings.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/CustomSettings.java
@@ -159,4 +159,39 @@ public class CustomSettings {
         }
         prefs().edit().putStringSet("hiddenGalleryBuckets", set).apply();
     }
+
+    // Several photos/videos sent at once where 2+ carry different captions:
+    // an album bubble then shows none of them (MessageObject.GroupedMessages),
+    // so the attach sheet sends them ungrouped, as "Send without grouping"
+    // does. Key "autoUngroupCaptioned", default on, no UI yet.
+    public static boolean isAutoUngroupCaptioned() {
+        return prefs().getBoolean("autoUngroupCaptioned", true);
+    }
+
+    public static void setAutoUngroupCaptioned(boolean enabled) {
+        prefs().edit().putBoolean("autoUngroupCaptioned", enabled).apply();
+    }
+
+    // Same caption on every item (the "caption for all media" leftovers) and
+    // paid media (one priced album) keep the stock album.
+    public static boolean shouldUngroupCaptioned(Iterable<?> items) {
+        if (!isAutoUngroupCaptioned()) {
+            return false;
+        }
+        Set<String> captions = new HashSet<>();
+        for (Object o : items) {
+            if (!(o instanceof MediaController.PhotoEntry)) {
+                continue;
+            }
+            MediaController.PhotoEntry entry = (MediaController.PhotoEntry) o;
+            if (entry.starsAmount > 0) {
+                return false;
+            }
+            String caption = entry.caption != null ? entry.caption.toString().trim() : "";
+            if (!caption.isEmpty()) {
+                captions.add(caption);
+            }
+        }
+        return captions.size() >= 2;
+    }
 }
